SOAPBOX: Much tougher conditions than last year. Ran HP for the first time, search and pounce, with the Flex Aurora at 500W. Conditions were late to open on Saturday morning (local) on the high bands, but Sunday was much better with 20, 15, and 10 all opening up several hours earlier than the day before. Got up before sunrise Sunday to get to snag Zone 25, 30, 31, and 40. This is one of my favorite contests to kick off the season. Live streamed a good portion over on YouTube. If you worked me, chances are you can probably find our QSO in one of the three live streams. Thank you to everyone who was out there this weekend. Hope you all have a fantastic contest season ahead. 73!
